{"3963490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "LYSA HORA: The Haunted Hill", "steam_appid": 3963490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/2c93d0a2088d844f6ee2aa10519ecea5.avif?t=1785276863\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras_big/2c93d0a2088d844f6ee2aa10519ecea5.avif?t=1785276863 width=1560 height=636 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a college student who has just moved to a big city in search of a new life. But instead of a fresh start, you begin to suffer from recurring nightmares. In your dreams, you see a mysterious hill. It’s calling you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night the visions grow more vivid: underground tunnels, abandoned structures, and a strange device that once kept something contained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/d4859443ac1139d8da4003ed02b37be5.avif?t=1785276863\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras_big/d4859443ac1139d8da4003ed02b37be5.webp?t=1785276863 width=1560 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trying to understand what’s happening, you uncover classified documents hidden in the city archives. What you discover leaves you with only one choice — go to the hill yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to end the nightmares is to reach their source. But not everything buried underground should be awakened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/e83b06c88c4524eac184275fe7d69dd2.avif?t=1785276863\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras_big/e83b06c88c4524eac184275fe7d69dd2.webp?t=1785276863 width=1560 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark atmospheric horror experience inspired by real locations. Explore the remains of an old fortress, labyrinthine tunnels, a shadowed forest, and ancient shrines hidden beneath the hill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate your surroundings, piece together fragments of a buried truth, solve environmental puzzles, and navigate dangerous terrain with light parkour elements as you descend deeper into the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/faa3c859f3f5328d0fae52954fd4ffe6.avif?t=1785276863\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras_big/faa3c859f3f5328d0fae52954fd4ffe6.webp?t=1785276863 width=1560 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every discovery brings you closer to the truth — and to an ancient horror that has slept beneath the hill for centuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions will lead to one of three different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/494524ae8448e6d9d29a544b45ef8d88.avif?t=1785276863\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras_big/494524ae8448e6d9d29a544b45ef8d88.webp?t=1785276863 width=1560 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a former Lead Level Designer of a major AAA Chernobyl-themed project, with a strong focus on immersion, tension, and environmental storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/2c93d0a2088d844f6ee2aa10519ecea5.avif?t=1785276863\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras_big/2c93d0a2088d844f6ee2aa10519ecea5.avif?t=1785276863 width=1560 height=636 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a college student who has just moved to a big city in search of a new life. But instead of a fresh start, you begin to suffer from recurring nightmares. In your dreams, you see a mysterious hill. It’s calling you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night the visions grow more vivid: underground tunnels, abandoned structures, and a strange device that once kept something contained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/d4859443ac1139d8da4003ed02b37be5.avif?t=1785276863\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras_big/d4859443ac1139d8da4003ed02b37be5.webp?t=1785276863 width=1560 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trying to understand what’s happening, you uncover classified documents hidden in the city archives. What you discover leaves you with only one choice — go to the hill yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to end the nightmares is to reach their source. But not everything buried underground should be awakened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/e83b06c88c4524eac184275fe7d69dd2.avif?t=1785276863\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras_big/e83b06c88c4524eac184275fe7d69dd2.webp?t=1785276863 width=1560 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark atmospheric horror experience inspired by real locations. Explore the remains of an old fortress, labyrinthine tunnels, a shadowed forest, and ancient shrines hidden beneath the hill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate your surroundings, piece together fragments of a buried truth, solve environmental puzzles, and navigate dangerous terrain with light parkour elements as you descend deeper into the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/faa3c859f3f5328d0fae52954fd4ffe6.avif?t=1785276863\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras_big/faa3c859f3f5328d0fae52954fd4ffe6.webp?t=1785276863 width=1560 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every discovery brings you closer to the truth — and to an ancient horror that has slept beneath the hill for centuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions will lead to one of three different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/494524ae8448e6d9d29a544b45ef8d88.avif?t=1785276863\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras_big/494524ae8448e6d9d29a544b45ef8d88.webp?t=1785276863 width=1560 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a former Lead Level Designer of a major AAA Chernobyl-themed project, with a strong focus on immersion, tension, and environmental storytelling.</p><p class